        "original_id": "2e2dca76-6550-50eb-a928-2ff5228c91a3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nicole Morier, Selena Gomez, Madonna, Patrick Leonard, Destinee & Paris\n- Songs: \"Rock Me In\", \"Whiplash\", \"La Isla Bonita\"\n- Topics: songwriting collaborations, Latin pop influence, musical influences\n\nFacts:\n- Nicole Morier co-wrote \"Rock Me In\" with a country singer.\n- Nicole Morier co-wrote \"Whiplash\" for Selena Gomez & the Scene with the same country singer.\n- Nicole Morier and the country singer also wrote another song with a Latin pop influence.\n- The Latin pop influence of that song was described as similar to Madonna's \"La Isla Bonita.\"\n- Madonna co-wrote and co-produced \"La Isla Bonita\" with Patrick Leonard.\n- Destinee & Paris cited the country singer as an influence.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
