        "text": "A country singer and Nicole Morier wrote \"Rock Me In\", \"Whiplash\" for Selena Gomez & the Scene song, and one other song. That other song has a Latin pop influence, similar to La Isla Bonita by Madonna that was co-written and co-produced by her and Patrick Leonard. Destinee & Paris cited the singer as an influence.",
