        "original_id": "4daf4f0c-5847-5912-9acd-549cba6813f2",
        "text": "Page: Mmm Papi. Sentence: \"Mmm Papi\" is noted for having a Latin pop influence, similar to Madonna's \"La Isla Bonita\" (1987).\nPage: La Isla Bonita. Sentence: \"La Isla Bonita\" (English: The Beautiful Island ) is a song by American singer Madonna from her third studio album \"True Blue\" (1986).\nPage: La Isla Bonita. Sentence: She and Patrick Leonard co-wrote and co-produced the song, and Bruce Gaitsch provided additional songwriting.\nPage: Whiplash (Selena Gomez &amp; the Scene song). Sentence: Together, they wrote \"Mmm Papi\", \"Rock Me In\" and \"Whiplash\".\nPage: Destinee &amp; Paris. Sentence: Born and raised in New Jersey, now Los Angeles-based, the sisters cite their influences as Britney Spears, Michael Jackson, Christina Aguilera, Beyoncé, Katy Perry, Rihanna, and Gwen Stefani.",
